### Unix socket only: list unresolved source writes for one registered project
GET /local/v1/recovery/intents?project_id=11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111 HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost

### Unix socket only: keep the reviewed current source and reject the interrupted command
POST /local/v1/recovery/intents/019913e8-8000-7000-8000-000000000001/abandon HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost
Content-Type: application/json

